<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris Q1 net rises 80 pct.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris Q1 net rises 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		 (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  96/97		  95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		  350.35    vs	316.23</p>
<p>    Net profit		 23.87    vs	 13.23</p>
<p>    Tax provision	     1.70    vs	  3.11</p>
<p>NOTE - Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd makes rubber products and agricultural equipment and is involved in trading and estate management.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
